# Witness: a one-digit exclusion citation

Writing EX-4 where EX-04 was meant is the commonest way this citation goes wrong. The first
attempt required two or more digits, so the mistake was silently ignored rather than reported.

## 9. Exclusions

| ID | Status | Exclusion |
|---|---|---|
| EX-04 | Open | Packaging is not gated at this milestone. |
